@base = http://localhost:3000

### Products
GET {{base}}/products

### Create cart
# @name cart
POST {{base}}/carts

### Add item
POST {{base}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "sku_sneaker_ltd", "quantity": 1 }

### Change quantity
PATCH {{base}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/items/sku_sneaker_ltd
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2 }

### View cart
GET {{base}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}

### Checkout (send twice with the same key: the second call replays the same order)
# @name order
POST {{base}}/carts/{{cart.response.body.id}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-checkout-1

{}

### Get order
GET {{base}}/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}

### Admin: generate coupon (409 until the nth order)
POST {{base}}/admin/coupons

### Admin: list coupons
GET {{base}}/admin/coupons

### Admin: report
GET {{base}}/admin/report

### Admin: change price / stock
PATCH {{base}}/admin/products/sku_mug
Content-Type: application/json

{ "priceCents": 1400, "stock": 10 }
